  <Title type="string">Against the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Agnès O'Shaughnessy talks about silence, in three coats of varnish. The artist brought a canvas, unwrapped it, looked at it, and wrapped it again.</synopsis>
